LEARN.diagram('eco-pyramid', `<svg viewBox="0 0 440 272" role="img" aria-label="生態ピラミッド。生産者の上に一次・二次・三次消費者が重なり、上ほど個体数や量が少ない"><defs><marker id="ah-ep" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="8.5" refY="5" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" orient="auto-start-reverse"><path d="M0,0L10,5L0,10z" class="fg-pen"/></marker></defs><rect x="10.0" y="200" width="380" height="42" rx="4" class="fg-s"/><rect x="10.0" y="200" width="380" height="42" rx="4" class="st-s" stroke-width="1.4"/><text x="200.0" y="218.0" font-size="13" text-anchor="middle" class="fg-card" font-weight="700">生産者</text><text x="200.0" y="234.0" font-size="10.5" text-anchor="middle" class="fg-card">植物・植物プランクトン</text><rect x="47.0" y="152" width="306" height="42" rx="4" class="fg-soft"/><rect x="47.0" y="152" width="306" height="42" rx="4" class="st-s" stroke-width="1.4"/><text x="200.0" y="170.0" font-size="13" text-anchor="middle" class="fg-ink" font-weight="700">一次消費者</text><text x="200.0" y="186.0" font-size="10.5" text-anchor="middle" class="fg-ink2">草食動物（バッタ・動物プランクトン）</text><rect x="82.0" y="104" width="236" height="42" rx="4" class="fg-soft"/><rect x="82.0" y="104" width="236" height="42" rx="4" class="st-s" stroke-width="1.4"/><text x="200.0" y="122.0" font-size="13" text-anchor="middle" class="fg-ink" font-weight="700">二次消費者</text><text x="200.0" y="138.0" font-size="10.5" text-anchor="middle" class="fg-ink2">小型の肉食動物（カエル・小魚）</text><rect x="116.0" y="56" width="168" height="42" rx="4" class="fg-soft"/><rect x="116.0" y="56" width="168" height="42" rx="4" class="st-s" stroke-width="1.4"/><text x="200.0" y="74.0" font-size="13" text-anchor="middle" class="fg-ink" font-weight="700">三次消費者</text><text x="200.0" y="90.0" font-size="10.5" text-anchor="middle" class="fg-ink2">大型の肉食動物（ヘビ・タカ）</text><line x1="414.0" y1="236.0" x2="414.0" y2="64.0" class="st-pen" stroke-width="1.8" marker-end="url(#ah-ep)"/><text x="404.0" y="96.0" font-size="11" text-anchor="end" class="fg-pen" font-weight="700">上ほど</text><text x="404.0" y="112.0" font-size="11" text-anchor="end" class="fg-pen" font-weight="700">少ない</text><text x="200.0" y="262.0" font-size="11" text-anchor="middle" class="fg-ink2">食べる・食べられるの関係で、エネルギーは上へ行くほど大きく減る</text></svg>`);
